24	   component library and adding one for a single dropdown is a poor trade.
25	   What it does implement, because these are the parts that are actually
26	   load-bearing and are what a hand-rolled menu usually skips:
27	     - Escape closes and returns focus to the trigger
28	     - ArrowUp/Down/Home/End move a roving focus
29	     - a pointerdown listener outside the menu closes it
30	     - aria-expanded / aria-haspopup / role=menu wiring
31	   It does NOT implement collision detection against the viewport; instead the
32	   caller picks a side, and `align` covers the two cases the product has. */
